@Api = http://localhost:5036

### List all receipts
GET {{Api}}/api/receipts

### Export confirmed receipts as CSV (September 2026; "to" is the day after the last one)
GET {{Api}}/api/receipts/export.csv?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-10-01

### Upload a receipt (change the path to one of your images)
POST {{Api}}/api/receipts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=receipt

--receipt
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="20251220_DataBlitz.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../datasets/labels/20251220_DataBlitz.jpg
--receipt--

### Check one receipt (paste the id from the upload response)
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{Api}}/api/receipts/{{id}}

### Confirm / correct the fields
PUT {{Api}}/api/receipts/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant": "DataBlitz",
  "date": "2025-12-20",
  "total": 10495.00,
  "vatAmount": 1124.46,
  "vatableSales": 9370.54,
  "category": "Other"
}

### Retry a failed extraction
POST {{Api}}/api/receipts/{{id}}/retry

### Re-extract, keeping the fields you corrected (the model is told they're correct)
POST {{Api}}/api/receipts/{{id}}/reextract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fields": { "total": 443.86, "vatAmount": 23.14 },
  "locked": ["total", "vat_amount"]
}

### Delete a receipt and its image files
DELETE {{Api}}/api/receipts/{{id}}

### Delete several receipts
POST {{Api}}/api/receipts/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": ["{{id}}"] }
